    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "R-Typography: award-winning independent type foundry founded 2008 by Rui Abreu, now run with Catarina Vaz from Porto, Portugal. Retail library includes Basilar (rational sans, multiplexed), Ramboia (playful variable display, TDC 2025 Certificate of Excellence), Montris (optical-size serif for editorial), Staff (extended display), and others. Multiple TDC + Hiiibrand awards across 15+ years. Senior/founder-level; autonomous studio with high output. Email confirmed: info@r-typography.com. No LinkedIn company page found; foundry only lists Instagram and BlueSky on their contact page. Sources: r-typography.com/about, r-typography.com/contact, Fontstand, Fonts In Use.",
